    "@type": "Question",
    "name": "What is claims management system?",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
     "@type": "Answer",
     "text": "To acquire and process information on the underlying policy and coverages, the claim, and the claimant, an adjuster or claims handler (or an automated process) uses a claims management system, which is primarily a transaction-enabled system of records."
    }
