   {
    "@type": "Question",
    "name": "What is agency business model?",
    "acceptedAnswer": {
     "@type": "Answer",
     "text": "The agency-based business model produces a pool of experts who can offer solutions to consumer problems. Together, a business and an agency outsource non-core business operations. Among these duties are branding, marketing, advertising, and public relations."
    }
   },
